                  本页指数由深圳证券信息有限公司（“深证信息”）代表中华证券交易服务有限公司（“中华公司”）计算及/或发布。深证信息、中华公司对指数及/或其相关数据的准确性、完整性、及时性及适用性不作任何明示或暗示的担保。对于任何人因使用该指数及/或其中的数据或信息而遭受的任何直接或间接的损害、损失、支出或费用，中华公司及/或深证信息亦不承担任何责任。
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- 表现 -->
            <div class="el-col el-col-xs-24" v-show="mobileActiveName == 1">
              <div class="m-chart-box wrapper bg-white">
                <div class="stock-detail" v-show="realtimemarket != 0">
                  <div class="el-col-13">
                    <div class="el-col-24">
                      <div class="float-left stock-detail-count" :class="[indexChg > 0 ? 'up' : 'down']">
                        {{indexCurrent}}
                        <i class="iconfont" :class="[indexChg > 0 ? 'icon-shangzhang' : 'icon-xiadie']"></i>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="el-col-24">
                      <div class="float-left stock-detail-item" :class="[indexChg > 0 ? 'up' : 'down']">
                        <span v-if="indexChg > 0">+</span>
                        {{indexChg}}
                      </div>
                      <div class="float-left stock-detail-item"  :class="[indexChg > 0 ? 'up' : 'down']" style="margin-left: 10px">
                        <span v-if="indexChg > 0">+</span>
                        {{indexPercent}}%
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="el-col-11" v-if="!isHsiIndex">
                    <div class="float-right stock-detail-item">成交额:</div>
                    <div class="float-right stock-detail-item">{{indexMoney}}元</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="overflow-hidden wrapper bg-white" style="padding: 0 10px 10px 10px">
                <div class="el-col el-col-xs-24 mt-10">
                  <div class="select-chart-type el-col-xs-24">
                    <div class="el-col-xs-8">
                      <el-input @focus="mobileFullScreenDialog = true" placeholder="时间区间" size="mini" suffix-icon="el-icon-date"></el-input>
                    </div>
                    <!-- 国证恒生指数不显示图形类型和频次 -->
                    <div class="el-col-xs-8" v-if="!isHsiIndex" style="text-align: center">
                      <el-dropdown class="mobile-box" @command="changeChartType">
                        <span class="el-dropdown-link">
                          {{chartTypeList[currentChartType]}}
                          <i class="el-icon-arrow-down el-icon--right"></i>
                        </span>
                        <el-dropdown-menu slot="dropdown">
                          <el-dropdown-item command="line" :disabled="isContrast">折线图</el-dropdown-item>
                          <el-dropdown-item v-if="dateOptionValue != '1D'" command="candlestick" :disabled="isContrast || realtimemarket == 0">
                            K线图
                          </el-dropdown-item>
                          <el-dropdown-item command="area" :disabled="isContrast">面积图</el-dropdown-item>
                        </el-dropdown-menu>
                      </el-dropdown>
                    </div>
                    <div class="el-col-xs-8" v-if="!isHsiIndex">
                      <span class="hidden-ip5">频次：</span>
                      <el-dropdown class="mobile-box" size="mini" @command="clickChartFrequency">
                        <span class="el-dropdown-link">
                          {{chartFrequencyList[chartFrequencyType]}}
                          <i class="el-icon-arrow-down el-icon--right"></i>
                        </span>
                        <el-dropdown-menu slot="dropdown">
                          <template v-if="dateOptionValue == '1D'">
                            <el-dropdown-item command="m1">1min</el-dropdown-item>
                            <el-dropdown-item command="m15" :disabled="indexType == 700">15min</el-dropdown-item>
                            <el-dropdown-item command="m30" :disabled="indexType == 700">30min</el-dropdown-item>
                            <el-dropdown-item command="m60" :disabled="indexType == 700">60min</el-dropdown-item>
                          </template>
                          <template v-else>
                            <el-dropdown-item command="day" :disabled="isContrast">日</el-dropdown-item>
                            <el-dropdown-item command="week" :disabled="isContrast || indexType == 700 || freqRange === 'day'">周</el-dropdown-item>
                            <el-dropdown-item
                              command="month"
                              :disabled="isContrast || indexType == 700 || freqRange === 'day' || freqRange === 'week'"
                            >
                              月
                            </el-dropdown-item>
                          </template>
                        </el-dropdown-menu>
                      </el-dropdown>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="stock-chart-box wrapper bg-white">
                <div id="mchart" class="mchart" style="width: 100%; height: 400px" v-show="showStockChart"></div>
                <div
                  style="width: 100%; height: 600px; background-image: url('/image/no-data-chart.png'); background-size: cover"
                  v-show="!showStockChart"
                ></div>
              </div>
              <div v-if="!isHsiIndex" class="stock-table-box bg-whitv-wrapper" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #ebeef5">
                <el-table class="mt-20" :data="incomeList">
                  <el-table-column label="" style="font-size: 12px">
                    <el-table-column :label="incomeDate" prop="indexname" width="100"></el-table-column>
                  </el-table-column>
                  <el-table-column label="阶段性收益" align="center" cell-style="background:#000">
                    <el-table-column prop="perIncome1m" label="1M" align="center" width="69"></el-table-column>
                    <el-table-column prop="perIncome3m" label="3M" align="center" width="69"></el-table-column>
                    <el-table-column prop="perIncomeYtd" label="YTD" align="center" width="72"></el-table-column>
                  </el-table-column>
                  <el-table-column label="年化收益率" align="center">
                    <el-table-column prop="annIncome1y" label="1Y" align="center" width="72"></el-table-column>
                    <el-table-column prop="annIncome3y" label="3Y" align="center" width="70"></el-table-column>
                    <el-table-column prop="annIncome5y" label="5Y" align="center" width="70"></el-table-column>
                  </el-table-column>
                  <el-table-column label="年化波动率" align="center">
                    <el-table-column prop="annVolatility1y" label="1Y" align="center" width="80"></el-table-column>
                    <el-table-column prop="annVolatility3y" label="3Y" align="center" width="80"></el-table-column>
                    <el-table-column prop="annVolatility5y" label="5Y" align="center" width="80"></el-table-column>
                  </el-table-column>
                </el-table>
              </div>

              <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #ebeef5" class="index-analysis" v-show="indexAnalysisFlag">
                <el-table class="mt-20" border :data="indexAnalysis">
                  <el-table-column label="计算日期" prop="genDate" align="center"></el-table-column>
                  <el-table-column label="总市值*" prop="totalMarketValue" align="center">
                    <template slot="header" slot-scope="scope">
                      <el-tooltip content="单位为亿元" effect="light" placement="top">
                        <span class="header-with-tooltip">总市值*</span>
                      </el-tooltip>
                    </template>
                  </el-table-column>
                  <el-table-column label="到期收益率" prop="yieldMaturity" align="center"></el-table-column>
                  <el-table-column label="修正久期" prop="modifiedDuration" align="center"></el-table-column>
                  <el-table-column label="凸性" prop="convexity" align="center"></el-table-column>
                  <el-table-column label="平均剩余期限" prop="avgResidualMaturity" align="center"></el-table-column>
                </el-table>
              </div>

              <div v-show="showEchart" class="echarts-box bg-white wrapper" style="padding: 0">
                <div class="right-content bg-white">
                  <div class="title-box">
                    <div class="sub-title">市场分布</div>
                    <div class="m-right-time">{{marketDate}}</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="" style="position: relative">
                    <div id="mecharts1" style="height: 380px"></div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="right-content bg-white">
                  <div class="title-box">
                    <div class="sub-title">行业分布</div>
                    <div class="m-right-time">{{tradeDate}}</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="" style="position: relative">
                    <div id="mecharts2" style="height: 380px"></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- 行情 -->
            <div v-show="mobileActiveName == 2">
              <div class="sub-select-box-md bg-white">
                <div class="overflow-hidden">
                  <div>
                    <div class="el-col-12">
                      起：
                      <el-input size="small" style="width: 100px" id="mIndexDateStart" v-model="startAndEndTimeHistory[0]"></el-input>
                    </div>
                    <div class="el-cik-12">
                      终：
                      <el-input size="small" style="width: 100px" id="mIndexDateEnd" v-model="startAndEndTimeHistory[1]"></el-input>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div class="select-chart-type">
                    <div class="float-left download-btn">
                      <el-button type="button" class="el-button el-button--mini" @click="queryIndexHistoryList">
                        <i class="iconfont icon-index_search"></i>
                        <span>搜索</span>
                      </el-button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="float-left" v-if="!isHsiIndex">
                      频次：
                      <el-dropdown class="mobile-box" @command="clickHistoryFrequency">
                        <span class="el-dropdown-link">
                          {{chartFrequencyList[historyFrequencyType]}}
                          <i class="el-icon-arrow-down el-icon--right"></i>
                        </span>
                        <el-dropdown-menu slot="dropdown">
                          <el-dropdown-item command="day">日</el-dropdown-item>
                          <el-dropdown-item command="week" :disabled="freqRange === 'day'">周</el-dropdown-item>
                          <el-dropdown-item command="month" :disabled="freqRange === 'day' || freqRange === 'week'">月</el-dropdown-item>
                          <!-- <el-dropdown-item command="year" :disabled="indexSource == 0">年</el-dropdown-item> -->
                        </el-dropdown-menu>
                      </el-dropdown>
                    </div>
                    <div class="download-btn">
                      <el-button
                        type="button"
                        class="el-button el-button--mini"
                        @click="historyDownload"
                        :disabled="!historyShowData || historyShowData.length == 0"
                      >
                        <i class="iconfont icon-xiazai"></i>
                        <span>下载</span>
                      </el-button>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class=""></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="history-table-box table-align-top big-table" v-show="realtimemarket > 0">
                <el-table class="mt-20" :data="historyShowData" style="width: 100%" v-loading="historyLoading">
                  <el-table-column prop="date" label="日期" width="100"></el-table-column>
                  <el-table-column label="开盘价" align="right" v-if="realtimemarket > 0">
                    <template slot-scope="scope">{{scope.row.open ? scope.row.open : '-'}}</template>
                  </el-table-column>

                  <el-table-column label="最高价" align="right">
                    <template slot-scope="scope">{{scope.row.high ? scope.row.high : '-'}}</template>
                  </el-table-column>
                  <el-table-column label="收盘价" align="right">
                    <template slot-scope="scope">{{scope.row.close ? scope.row.close : '-'}}</template>
                  </el-table-column>
                </el-table>
                <div class="scroll-load scroll-load-1">
                  <div class="page-info">
                    共
                    <span>{{historyAllDataTotal}}</span>
                    条 已显示
                    <span>{{historyShowData.length}}</span>
                    条

                    <i v-show="historyAllDataTotal >  historyShowData.length" class="down-icon el-icon-arrow-down"></i>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="history-table-box-1 table-align-top big-table" v-show="realtimemarket == 0">
                <el-table class="" :data="historyShowData" style="width: 100%" v-loading="historyLoading" v-if="realtimemarket == 0">
                  <el-table-column prop="date" label="日期"></el-table-column>
                  <el-table-column label="收盘价" align="right">
                    <template slot-scope="scope">{{scope.row.close ? scope.row.close : '-'}}</template>
                  </el-table-column>
                  <div class="scroll-load scroll-load-1">
                    <div class="page-info">
                      共
                      <span>{{historyAllDataTotal}}</span>
                      条 已显示
                      <span>{{historyShowData.length}}</span>
                      条
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </el-table>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- 样本详情 -->
            <div v-show="mobileActiveName == 3">
              <div class="sub-select-box-md bg-white">
                <div class="overflow-hidden">
                  <div
                    class="select-time-selection"
                    style="margin-right: 20px"
                    v-if="isHsiIndex || !(newIndexType != true && (indexType != 107 || indexType != 207))"
                  >
                    <el-date-picker
                      size="small"
                      style="width: 120px"
                      v-model="currDate"
                      type="month"
                      placeholder="选择日期"
                      value-format="yyyy-MM"
                      @change="changeSampleDate"
                    ></el-date-picker>
                  </div>
                  <div class="download-box">
                    <div class="download-btn-left">
                      <button type="button" class="el-button el-button--mini" @click="downloadSample">
                        <i class="iconfont icon-xiazai"></i>
                        <span>当前样本</span>
                      </button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="excel-btn" v-if="!isHsiIndex && newIndexType != true">
                      <button type="button" class="el-button el-button--mini" @click="downloadHistory">
                        <i class="iconfont icon-excel"></i>
                        <span>样本权重</span>
                      </button>
                      <button type="button" class="el-button el-button--mini" @click="downloadAdjustment">
                        <i class="iconfont icon-excel"></i>
                        <span>历史调样</span>
                      </button>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="history-table-box table-align-top" v-show="newIndexType == true">
                  <!-- 新版债券指数 -->
                  <el-table class="mt-20" :data="sampleList" style="width: 100%">
                    <el-table-column prop="dateStr" label="日期"></el-table-column>
                    <el-table-column label="深市代码" align="right">
                      <template slot-scope="scope">{{scope.row.szseCode ? scope.row.szseCode : '--'}}</template>
                    </el-table-column>
                    <el-table-column label="沪市代码" align="right">
                      <template slot-scope="scope">{{scope.row.sseCode ? scope.row.sseCode : '--'}}</template>
                    </el-table-column>
                    <el-table-column label="银行间代码" align="right">
                      <template slot-scope="scope">{{scope.row.interBankCode ? scope.row.interBankCode : '--'}}</template>
                    </el-table-column>
                    <el-table-column prop="secname" label="样本简称" align="right"></el-table-column>
                    <el-table-column prop="weight" label="权重(%)" align="right"></el-table-column>
                  </el-table>
                  <div class="scroll-load scroll-load-2">
                    <div class="page-info">
                      共
                      <span>{{sampleTotal}}</span>
                      条 已显示
                      <span>{{sampleList.length}}</span>
                      条
                      <i v-if="sampleTotal > sampleList.length" class="down-icon el-icon-arrow-down"></i>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="history-table-box table-align-top" v-show="newIndexType != true">
                  <!-- 非债券指数 -->
                  <el-table class="mt-20" :data="sampleList" style="width: 100%" v-if="newIndexType != true">
                    <el-table-column prop="dateStr" label="日期" width="90"></el-table-column>
                    <!-- <el-table-column prop="indexcode" label="指数代码" v-if="!isHsiIndex" align="right"></el-table-column>
                    <el-table-column prop="indexname" label="指数简称" v-if="!isHsiIndex" align="right"></el-table-column> -->
                    <el-table-column prop="seccode" label="样本代码" width="90" align="right"></el-table-column>
                    <el-table-column prop="secname" label="样本简称" width="120" align="right"></el-table-column>
                    <el-table-column
                      prop="trade"
                      label="所属行业"
                      width="120"
                      align="right"
                      v-if="indexType != 107 && indexType != 207"
                    ></el-table-column>
                    <!-- <el-table-column align="right" v-if="!isHsiIndex && newIndexType != true">
                                    <template slot="header" slot-scope="props">
                                        <el-tooltip class="item" effect="dark" content="总市值单位为亿元" placement="top">
                                            <span>{{'总市值*'}}</span>
                                        </el-tooltip>
                                    </template>
                                    <template slot-scope="scope">
                                        {{scope.row.totalMarketValue ? scope.row.totalMarketValue.toFixed(2) : '--'}}
                                    </template>
                                </el-table-column>
                                <el-table-column prop="weight" label="权重(%)" align="right"></el-table-column> -->
                    <el-table-column prop="weight" label="权重(%)" align="right">
                      <template slot-scope="scope">{{scope.row.weight ? scope.row.weight : '--'}}</template>
                    </el-table-column>
                  </el-table>
                  <div class="scroll-load scroll-load-2">
                    <div class="page-info">
                      共
                      <span>{{sampleTotal}}</span>
                      条 已显示
                      <span>{{sampleList.length}}</span>
                      条
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- 产品 -->
            <div v-show="mobileActiveName == 4">
              <div class="history-table-box table-align-top big-table" style="border-top: 1px solid #d9d9d9; background-color: #fff">
                <el-table class="mt-20" :data="fundList" style="width: 100%" v-loading="fundLoading">
                  <el-table-column prop="fundCode" label="基金代码" align="left">
                    <template slot-scope="scope">
                      <span class="table-small-item">{{scope.row.fundCode}}</span>
                    </template>
                  </el-table-column>
                  <el-table-column label="基金名称" align="left" width="120">
                    <template slot-scope="scope">
                      <span class="table-small-item">{{scope.row.fundName}}</span>
                    </template>
                  </el-table-column>
                  <el-table-column prop="fundDate" label="成立日期" align="right" width="95">
                    <template slot-scope="scope">
                      <span class="table-small-item">{{scope.row.fundDate}}</span>
                    </template>
                  </el-table-column>
                  <el-table-column prop="fundScale" align="right" width="90">
                    <template slot="header" slot-scope="props">
                      <el-tooltip class="item" effect="dark" content="净值规模单位为亿元" placement="top">
                        <span>{{'净值规模*'}}</span>
                      </el-tooltip>
                    </template>
                    <template slot-scope="scope">
                      <span class="table-small-item">{{scope.row.fundScale ? scope.row.fundScale : '--'}}</span>
                    </template>
                  </el-table-column>
                  <el-table-column prop="fundNetValue" align="right">
                    <template slot="header" slot-scope="props">
                      <el-tooltip class="item" effect="dark" content="单位净值单位为元" placement="top">
                        <span>{{'单位净值*'}}</span>
                      </el-tooltip>
                    </template>
                    <template slot-scope="scope">
                      <span class="table-small-item">{{scope.row.fundNetValue ? scope.row.fundNetValue : '--'}}</span>
                    </template>
                  </el-table-column>
                  <el-table-column prop="fundType" label="基金类型" align="right">
                    <template slot-scope="scope">
                      <span class="table-small-item">{{scope.row.fundType}}</span>
                    </template>
                  </el-table-column>
                  <el-table-column prop="foundLocation" label="上市地点" align="right" width="120">
                    <template slot-scope="scope">
                      <span class="table-small-item">{{scope.row.foundLocation ? scope.row.foundLocation : '--'}}</span>
                    </template>
                  </el-table-column>
                  <!--<el-table-column prop="fundManger" label="基金管理人" align="right">-->
                  <!--<template slot-scope="scope">-->
                  <!--<span class="table-small-item">{{scope.row.fundManger}}</span>-->
                  <!--</template>-->
                  <!--</el-table-column>-->
                </el-table>
                <div class="scroll-load scroll-load-3">
                  <div class="page-info" @click="">
                    共
                    <span>{{fundTotal}}</span>
                    条 已显示
                    <span>{{fundList.length}}</span>
                    条
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="explain">注：更新时间为 {{fundUpdateTime}}，此处展示承担业绩代表性的基金代码，净值规模按照份额合并统计。</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
